Juerd Waalboer writes:
> Does anyone know why it wasn't done in this much simpler way?
> 
>     sub refaddr($) {
>         ref($_[0]) ? 0+$_[0] : undef
>     }

Overloading.

  $ cat o.pl
  use strict;
  {
      package C;
      use overload '+' => sub { 17 };
      sub new { bless {}, $_[0] }
  }
  sub refaddr($) {
      ref($_[0]) ? 0+$_[0] : undef
  }
  my $x = C->new;
  my $y = C->new;
  print refaddr $x;
  print refaddr $y;
  $ perl -wl o.pl
  17
  17

-- 
Aaron Crane

